WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.650
I have got to thank Tank's Good News for this one.

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.790
I just love Tank's Good News so much,

3
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:09.670
and check out this 6 year old skater from Australia.

4
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.400
She recently put on her party dress

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.100
and dropped straight into a 12-foot bowl.

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.170
Paige Tobin has been skating since she was three

7
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.950
and she wants to go the Olympics one day.

8
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.640
We cannot wait to cheer you on Paige.

9
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.080
I know exactly where you're going

10
00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.880
and it's straight to the Olympics.

11
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.240
We get to meet you today though.

12
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.630
Even more importantly, I called the producers

13
00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.030
I was like "you guys have to look at this girl!

14
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:34.921
She's so amazing!"

15
00:00:34.921 --> 00:00:36.400
And guess what, she's here!

16
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.300
Paige Tobin and her mom, Emma!

17
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.740
Hi!
Hello!

18
00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.806
(crowd clapping)

19
00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:42.035
Oh my god!

20
00:00:42.035 --> 00:00:44.790
It's so great to be able to say hi to you.

21
00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.670
We have seen you do a 12 foot drop

22
00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.930
but is it true that you might've even done

23
00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:51.793
a taller one than that?

24
00:00:52.838 --> 00:00:55.280
Yeah. I've done 14-foot

25
00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.917 line:15%
and um, when I jump in,

26
00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.959 line:15%
it feels like I'm flying.

27
00:01:00.959 --> 00:01:03.570 line:15%
Aww, like you're flying.

28
00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.570 line:15%
I was blown away, when I saw your video.

29
00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:13.580 line:15%
Now, how did you come into the world of skateboarding?

30
00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.770 line:15%
Did you see something somewhere?

31
00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:17.060 line:15%
Was it in the neighborhood?

32
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:20.333
Like what opened your eyes to even try skateboarding?

33
00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.480
She was only three when she started.

34
00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.420
So when she's asked, if she remembers when she started,

35
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.430
she doesn't remember. (laughs)

36
00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:30.930
Can I ask you question,

37
00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:33.580
if other people are scared of things

38
00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.093
what would you tell them?

39
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.533
I'd say, don't, never give up.

40
00:01:43.340 --> 00:01:45.310
I'm, I can't even imagine,

41
00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:49.570
by the way, I just got a skateboard instructor

42
00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.860
to start teaching my daughter Olive, Paige.

43
00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.830
She's gonna be nine,

44
00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:58.609
and do you have any advice for her?

45
00:01:58.609 --> 00:02:01.522
Um, never give up.

46
00:02:01.522 --> 00:02:02.508
(crowd laughing)

47
00:02:02.508 --> 00:02:03.460
Yup.

48
00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:05.683
So you want to go to the Olympics one day?

49
00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.420
Yes.

50
00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:11.840
And if you won Olympic gold,

51
00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:14.013
what would you say in your speech?

52
00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.062
You should never give up.

53
00:02:17.062 --> 00:02:20.937
I knew it! That's what I'm saying you worked for,

54
00:02:20.937 --> 00:02:22.580
I love it!

55
00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:23.618
Oh my god.

56
00:02:23.618 --> 00:02:25.040
(host laugh)

57
00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:26.910
Oh Paige, I love you so much!

58
00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.110
and Emma, what a great mom, you are.

59
00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.130
Thank you.

60
00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.400
Thank you, Paige.

61
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.440
You brave brilliant girl. My goodness.

62
00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.850
Thank you so much for talking to us today.

63
00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.200
Keep it up. Never-

64
00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.380
Never give up!

65
00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.450
Never give up.

66
00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.250
(aughs)

67
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.670
Thanks guys.

68
00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.243
Thank you so much.

